OL,3,GNEWSASmall Welsh football club's
OL,4,Avictory over Italian giants brought to
OL,5,Alife on stage
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlmost 40 years after Merthyr Tydfil FC
OL,8,Fstunned Italian footballing giants
OL,9,FAtalanta in the European Cup Winners
OL,10,FCup, the remarkable story is being
OL,11,Fbrought back to life on the theatre
OL,12,Fstage.
OL,14,FThe comedy Just One Cornetto focuses on
OL,15,Fthe weeks leading up to the match at
OL,16,Fthe club's Penydarren Park, when
OL,17,FMerthyr defeated the team from Bergamo
OL,18,F2-1, in the first round of the
OL,19,Fcompetition.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
