OL,3,GNEWSASmall Welsh football club's
OL,4,Avictory over Italian giants brought to
OL,5,Alife on stage
OL,6,
OL,7,FDisappointment was to follow with the
OL,8,Fthousands who had travelled from
OL,9,FMerthyr to northern Italy having to
OL,10,Fsuffer a 2-0 loss, which meant Atalanta
OL,11,Fwould go through, eventually reaching
OL,12,Fthe semi-finals of the competition.
OL,14,FBut the drama of that first match, and
OL,15,Fthe attention on it at a time when
OL,16,FEnglish clubs were banned from European
OL,17,Ffootball, means it will go down in
OL,18,FWelsh footballing folklore.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
